{"id": "t000-001", "text": "Coffee with Tanvi this morning. Her sister Aditi is pregnant again, due around March 9th. Tanvi's thrilled but says Aditi's had awful morning sickness this time. Remind me to text Aditi on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around March 9th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "awful morning sickness", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Aditi", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-002", "text": "Long catch-up with Reggie and Ebony. They've finally set a date, wedding is June 3rd next year at her parents' place. Reggie's already stressing about the speech. Ebony wants a small do, maybe 60 people, but his mum has other ideas. Her brother Samir is flying back from Dubai for it and they've asked him to officiate, which he's thrilled about. Engagement photos are booked for May 20 at golden hour.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing about the speech", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a small do", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Dubai", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Engagement photos", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 20 at golden hour", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t000-003", "text": "Rang Dorota. Her dad's knee replacement got moved to Nov 12 at 8am. She's taking the whole week off to look after him. He's nervous, hasn't been in hospital since the 90s. Her brother Nikolai can't get leave so it's all on her, and she's still recovering from her own back thing. Remind me to text Dorota on the 11th in the evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 12 at 8am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "whole week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "back thing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Dorota", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 11th in the evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-004", "text": "Matteo and Sofia's 10th anniversary is 11/4. He wants to surprise her with a weekend in Lisbon but can't get the time off. Don't forget to ask him tomorrow evening if he sorted it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "10th anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/4", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend in Lisbon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-005", "text": "Bumped into Samir at the shops. Baby Zara arrived last Tuesday, 7lb 2oz, everyone doing well. He looked absolutely shattered but happy. Need to get a card and something small for the baby before Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arrived", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "absolutely shattered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "happy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card and something small for the baby", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-006", "text": "Mai called. The christening's been called off, the vicar's ill and they can't get another date. She's gutted, her mum had already flown in from Hanoi for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "vicar", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flown in from Hanoi", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t000-007", "text": "Imogen had her scan yesterday afternoon, all looks fine. It's a boy! Her partner Chidi cried apparently lol. They're doing a little gender reveal thing on the 22nd at 4.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little gender reveal thing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd at 4", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t000-012", "text": "Aurelio - allergic to shellfish, doesn't drink, massive Juventus fan. Wife is Manon, two kids both under 5. Lives out near the reservoir.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to shellfish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Juventus", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "under 5", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "Lives out near the reservoir", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t000-016", "text": "Omar and his wife renew their vows on Aug 9, 25 years married. He mentioned she's been dropping hints about a pearl necklace. Michael and I might chip in together.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "renew their vows", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Aug 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "25 years married", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a pearl necklace", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t000-019", "text": "Spoke to Noah. His partner Sophie had the baby early, May 14 at 3:40am, a little girl called Rose. Both in NICU for a few days but stable. Noah sounded wiped. Text him Wednesday to see how they're doing, and don't send flowers, the ward doesn't allow them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14 at 3:40am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rose", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in NICU", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wiped", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-020", "text": "Ali's appointment with the consultant is Thursday at 11. He's worried it's his heart again. I'm driving him there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried it's his heart again", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t000-022", "text": "Catch-up w Ebony. Her brother Michael proposed to his gf at the weekend, she said yes obviously. Ebony might be bridesmaid? Not sure how that works lol. She also starts physio for her shoulder on the 8th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gf", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 8th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t000-026", "text": "Sophie and Tunde got married on the 5th at the registry office, no guests, just told everyone after!! Party for friends on Oct 26 at 7pm at the Red Lion. We're going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got married", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 26 at 7pm", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t000-029", "text": "Dorota's dad is home!! Op went well, he's walking with a frame already. She said thanks for the flowers. Next check-up is Dec 1st at 9:15.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "check-up", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 1st at 9:15", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t000-030", "text": "Manon - 3rd baby due June 12th. Finds out the sex at the 20 week scan, end of Feb. Her husband Kofi wants a boy this time, they've got two girls. Remind me to get her something for the bump, she's always cold, maybe a nice blanket.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "20 week scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Feb", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girls", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her something for the bump", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "always cold", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t000-031", "text": "Long chat with Aurelio about his parents' 50th anniversary on April 19. The whole family's flying to Naples for it and he's organising a big lunch on the Sunday at noon. His sister Valentina is doing the cake. He's stressed about the seating plan already because two of his uncles don't speak.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "50th anniversary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 19", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Naples", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday at noon", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed about the seating plan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncles", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t000-032", "text": "Pedro's daughter Zoe has her tonsils out on the 14th at 7am, first op ever, she's terrified. He's taking the day off. Ask him that evening how she got on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "has her tonsils out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at 7am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "day off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-033", "text": "Remind me to ask Tanvi about her IVF appointment on Monday, she said the 9:30 one. Don't bring it up in front of her in-laws.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Tanvi about her IVF appointment", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tanvi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "IVF appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "in-laws", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t000-036", "text": "Ebony's sister had twins!! Born 9/30, two boys, both tiny but healthy. Ebony's flying to Atlanta next Thursday morning to help out for a fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twins", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Atlanta", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday morning", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t000-037", "text": "Christening for Kofi Mensah and Valentina's little one is Sunday Nov 16 at 11, St Mary's then lunch at theirs. I'm a godparent!!! Must buy a proper gift, silver something? Ask Val what they've already got.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi Mensah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little one", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday Nov 16 at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "godparent", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a proper gift", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Val what they've already got", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Val", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t000-040", "text": "Tendai and Omar's first anniversary is Feb 14, of course. He wants to recreate their first date at the ramen place in Soho. Tendai has no idea.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Feb 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recreate their first date at the ramen place in Soho", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t000-041", "text": "Quick call with Nikolai. His wife Dorota has her C-section booked for March 3rd at 8 in the morning. She's anxious after last time. Their older boy is staying with the grandparents that week. I should ring Dorota the night before to wish her luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "C-section", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd at 8 in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "older boy", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Dorota", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-043", "text": "Aditi's hen do is in Lisbon June 20-23, wedding July 5th. She's asked me to do a reading which is terrifying. Her fiance Omar is very chill about the whole thing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 20-23", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 5th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiance", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chill", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t000-044", "text": "Sofia's mum had a fall last week and broke her hip. Op went ok but rehab could take months. Sofia's been driving up every weekend and is exhausted. Remind me to check in with Sofia on Sunday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke her hip", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rehab", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every weekend", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Sofia", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t000-045", "text": "Ayesha is expecting! Due 4/22. She's been craving pickled onions lol. Her husband Tunde is painting the nursery yellow this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4/22", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "craving pickled onions", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "painting the nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t000-047", "text": "Remind me to ask Reggie how Ebony's dress fitting went, and to send Reggie the photographer's number.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Reggie how Ebony's dress fitting went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dress fitting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Reggie the photographer's number", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "photographer"}]}
{"id": "t000-051", "text": "Tunde's wife Imogen had their baby boy on Oct 18 at 11:52pm after 30 hours of labour, named him Kofi after Tunde's dad. Tunde says Imogen is recovering well but they're both running on fumes. Visitors welcome from next weekend. Need to sort a meal delivery for them this week, and get the baby that tiny Arsenal kit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby boy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 18 at 11:52pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "running on fumes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next weekend"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a meal delivery for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the baby that tiny Arsenal kit", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t000-054", "text": "Coffee with Ali. His husband Pedro has a hip replacement booked for Tuesday the 25th, first thing in the morning. Pedro's quite scared, he's never been under before. Ali's sorted the house, ramps, rails, the lot. Remind me to text Pedro good luck Monday night and Ali Tuesday evening to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday the 25th, first thing in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite scared", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Pedro good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ali", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evening", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t000-056", "text": "Saskia's IVF worked!!! She's 8 weeks. First scan is 11/10 at 3pm and her mum's going with her. She's nervous about telling work though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "IVF", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "First scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/10 at 3pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about telling work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t000-057", "text": "Remind me Monday to email Omar about the wedding RSVP, deadline is March 1.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email Omar about the wedding RSVP", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 1", "anchor": "a1"}]}
